87:/// Create or recover the coordinator for an app that has just registered.
88:///
89:/// A model mismatch leaves the live conversation intact; the app compares the
90:/// returned model with its requested model before asking for replacement.
91:/// `spawn.working_directory` is the prepared Boss-session directory; callers
92:/// resolve it once via [`coordinator_working_directory`]. `spawn.version_probe`
93:/// is only ever consulted when this call actually creates a new session (see
94:/// [`start_new`]).
95:pub(crate) async fn ensure_for_attach(spawn: &CoordinatorSpawn<'_>) -> Result<CoordinatorTmuxRecord> {
96:    match spawn.work_db.coordinator_tmux_record()? {
97:        None => start_new(spawn, CoordinatorStartReason::FirstCreation).await,
98:        Some(record) => reconcile_existing(spawn, record).await,
99:    }
100:}
