512:/// Content hash of the rendered prompt the coordinator actually reads.
513:/// Deliberately not mtime/size-based — see [`RENDERED_PROMPT_FILENAME`].
514:///
515:/// The hash is only meaningful once the app has prepared the session
516:/// directory for this launch (rewritten `CLAUDE.md` into
517:/// `working_directory`). Engine attach hashes this file after app
518:/// registration; coordinator creation already depends on that same
519:/// ordering.
520:fn hash_rendered_prompt(working_directory: &Path) -> Result<String> {
521:    let path = working_directory.join(RENDERED_PROMPT_FILENAME);
522:    let contents =
523:        std::fs::read(&path).with_context(|| format!("reading rendered coordinator prompt at {}", path.display()))?;
524:    let mut hasher = Sha256::new();
525:    hasher.update(&contents);
526:    Ok(format!("{:x}", hasher.finalize()))
527:}
